WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.859
Welcome to Orbit. Making your point. Our focus is Linking ideas.

2
00:00:06.859 --> 00:00:17.811
Although introduces a clause, despite takes a noun or ing form, and however links contrasting statements. In order to introduces a purpose.

3
00:00:17.811 --> 00:00:22.505
Although extra hours cost money, volunteers can help.

4
00:00:22.505 --> 00:00:27.784
The plan is useful. However, it needs more funding.

5
00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:31.463
They will run a trial in order to collect evidence.

6
00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:40.861
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
